            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不灵了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The API key was rejected. Check it in settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API Key 被拒绝，请检查后重新填写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The DSH engine runs locally on this device. Only model requests leave it, sent directly to the provider you choose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DSH 引擎在这台设备上本地运行，只有模型请求会发出去，直接发给你选择的服务商。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent can request supported system actions and shortcuts you allow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "智能体可以请求执行受支持的系统操作和你允许的快捷指令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent can use enabled system features and allowed shortcuts while a task runs. Sensitive actions still ask.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任务运行期间，智能体可以使用已开启的系统功能和允许的快捷指令。敏感操作仍需确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The chat and its history are removed from this device. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对话及其记录会从这台设备上删除，无法恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The chosen moment": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "天选时刻"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code says Happy New Year": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代码也拜个年"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine could not start": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引擎无法启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine could not start. Open the details to retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引擎无法启动，请打开详情重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine did not start in time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引擎启动超时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine ran out of memory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引擎内存不足。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine runs on this iPhone. Only model requests leave it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引擎在这台 iPhone 上运行，只有模型请求会发出去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine's launch environment already provides this key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "引擎的启动环境已经提供了这个 Key。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first setup takes a minute or two": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次准备约需一两分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder and its chats are kept. Chats become ungrouped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目录和对话会保留，对话将不再分组。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The host can keep working. DSH Fan reconnects when you return.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远程主机可继续工作，返回 DSH Fan 后会重新连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The iOS app uses the native interface for local and remote conversations.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS App 的本机和远程对话均使用原生界面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The image plays when DSH Fan opens, after the iOS launch screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 DSH Fan 时，在 iOS 启动画面之后显示这张图片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is stored by DSH on the remote host and used only for model requests.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Key 由远程主机上的 DSH 保存，只用于模型请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is stored by the engine on this device and used only for model requests.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Key 由本机引擎保存在这台设备上，只用于模型请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local engine is in safe mode, so the model can't use phone control.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地引擎处于安全模式，模型暂时无法使用手机控制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model can only run shortcuts you add here, with the exact name. It cannot change this list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型只能运行你在这里添加的快捷指令，名称必须完全一致；模型无法修改这个列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model has a question": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型有个问题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model just yawned": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它打了个哈欠"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model request timed out. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型请求超时，请重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model returned no reply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型没有返回内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model service is busy. Try again in a moment.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型服务繁忙，请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reply hit the length limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回复达到了长度上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The result returns to the local engine. Your model provider may receive it as part of the conversation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "操作结果会返回本机引擎，也可能随对话发送给模型渠道。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected preset changes how much the engine can do before asking for approval in new chats.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此预设会改变新对话中引擎可以直接执行的操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There’s more to this": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "问题不简单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There’s no earlier history to branch from": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前面没有可分叉的历史"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These capabilities are not installed on this host.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此主机尚未安装这些能力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "思考"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking effort": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "思考强度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking into the small hours": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
