      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "缩放"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dsh isn’t installed on the host. Install it and retry, or enter its full path as the start command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机上没有 dsh，装好后重试，或在启动命令里填完整路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS asks for each permission when you first use its feature. Review or change your choices in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次使用功能时，iOS 会请求相应权限。你可以在系统设置查看或更改授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS background limits": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 后台限制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS has no command sandbox for the engine, so full access is the default here; the app itself stays inside the iOS sandbox. Choose a stricter preset to approve actions yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 上引擎没有命令沙箱，所以这里默认使用完全访问；App 本身始终在 iOS 沙箱之内。想自己批准每个操作，可以选择更严格的档位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS manages speech recognition and any language data it needs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音识别和所需的语言数据由 iOS 管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS manages the display refresh rate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "屏幕刷新率由 iOS 管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS manages the speech model. Network recognition may use Apple’s speech service.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音模型由 iOS 管理。联网识别可能使用 Apple 的语音服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS may suspend DSH within seconds of leaving the app. A running turn can request a short extension, often around 30 seconds; the system decides the actual time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离开 App 后，iOS 可能在数秒内挂起 DSH。运行中的任务可申请短暂延长，通常约 30 秒，实际时间由系统决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS may suspend the app in the background.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 可能会在后台挂起 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS shows your pet on the Lock Screen and Dynamic Island while a Live Activity is available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时活动可用时，iOS 会在锁定屏幕和灵动岛上显示宠物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
